This file changes Splash by Inco (https://github.com/incoai/splash), licensed under the Apache License 2.0 (the text
is in Kapitsa's LICENSE). Modified by Nace AI, 2026. H1=3. A decode step's expert-load host step runs inside the command buffer, and a GPU gate replays the rest
of the command when the CPU did not release the step in time. Off unless SPLASH_KSX_H1=3 and SPLASH_KSX_KERNELS are set.
packaging/splash/build.py applies it, after the patches numbered before it, to the commit in pin.json.
Every file it changes gets a "Modified by Nace AI" line, and every change is marked KSX.

